  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENERGY EFFICIENCY EXCOM DECISION 94/60 (EE) PROJECT PREPARATION (PRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance energy efficiency in Egypt&apos;s Refrigeration, Air-Conditioning (RAC) manufacturing sector. The project will focus on capacity building, data collection, and developing a comprehensive project document to attract further investment. Key activities include training workshops for stakeholders on Minimum Energy Performance Standards (MEPS) and energy-efficient technologies, market surveys to assess energy consumption patterns, and consultations with industry and government representatives. The project aims to promote the manufacture and use of energy-efficient appliances, contributing to national energy savings and reduced greenhouse gas emissions.</narrative>
  </description>
